config BR2_PACKAGE_BHP_PRESENCE_SENSOR
	bool "bhp-presence-sensor"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Build the experimental BeagleBone House Panel PIR input
	  module and the separately named custom-driver and stock
	  gpio-keys Device Tree overlays.

	  The overlays are installed as inert experiment artifacts
	  and are not added to the boot flow. Neither overlay has
	  electrical or wake-cycle verification. They must never be
	  applied together because both claim the same candidate GPIO.

comment "bhp-presence-sensor needs a Linux kernel"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
